---
layout: base.njk
title: Astraea Fabrication
description: Custom countertop fabrication and installation. Granite, quartz, and marble countertops for kitchens, bathrooms, and commercial spaces in Shelburne and surrounding areas.
---

<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero__content">
    <span class="pill">Premium fabrication & installation</span>
    <h1 class="hero__headline">Custom Countertops Built to Last</h1>
    <p class="hero__copy">We specialize in custom countertop fabrication and installation with a commitment to quality and customer satisfaction. From granite to quartz to marble, we bring your vision to life.</p>
    <div class="hero__ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="#contact">Get a Free Quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#services">View Services</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__tags">
      <span class="hero__tag">Locally Owned</span>
      <span class="hero__tag">Transparent Pricing</span>
      <span class="hero__tag">Professional Installation</span>
      <span class="hero__tag">Free Estimates</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero__media">
    <div class="hero__image-wrapper">
      {% image "kitchen-countertop-install.jpg", "Custom marble kitchen countertop installation by Astraea Fabrication", "(min-width: 960px) 500px, 85vw", "eager", "high" %}
    </div>
    <div class="hero__info-cards">
      <div class="info-card info-card--why">
        <span class="info-card__label">Why Homeowners Choose Us</span>
        <ul class="info-card__list">
          <li>Clean Installs</li>
          <li>Strong Materials</li>
          <li>Honest Work</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="info-card info-card--booking">
        <span class="info-card__label">Now Booking</span>
        <ul class="info-card__list">
          <li>Kitchens</li>
          <li>Bathrooms</li>
          <li>Vanities</li>
          <li>And more</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section services" id="services">
  <header class="section__header">
    <span class="pill">Services</span>
    <h2>Quality work from fabrication to final install</h2>
    <p>We specialize in custom countertop fabrication and installation with a commitment to quality and customer satisfaction.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="grid grid--cols-4 services__grid animate-grid">
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Granite</h3>
      <p>Durable and elegant granite countertops in a variety of colors and patterns.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Quartz</h3>
      <p>Low-maintenance quartz surfaces that combine beauty with practicality.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Marble</h3>
      <p>Luxurious marble countertops for a timeless, sophisticated look.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="service-card">
      <h3>Edge Profiles</h3>
      <p>Multiple edge profile options to match your design preferences.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section highlights" id="materials">
  <header class="section__header">
    <span class="pill">Our Materials</span>
    <h2>Premium Stone, Expert Craftsmanship</h2>
    <p>Every project starts with hand-selected stone and ends with precision installation.</p>
  </header>
  <div class="highlights__grid animate-grid">
    {% for item in menu.featured %}
    <article class="highlight-card">
      <div class="highlight-card__media">
        {% image item.image, item.name, "(min-width: 720px) 300px, 85vw" %}
      </div>
      <div class="highlight-card__body">
        <h3>{{ item.name }}</h3>
        <p>{{ item.description }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section gallery" id="work">
  <header class="section__header">
    <span class="pill">Gallery</span>
    <h2>Our Work</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="gallery__grid animate-grid">
    <div class="gallery__item">
      {% image "kitchen-countertop-install.jpg", "Kitchen countertop installation with marble surface and wine fridge", "(min-width: 720px) 33vw, 85vw" %}
    </div>
    <div class="gallery__item">
      {% image "marble-shower-enclosure.jpg", "Custom marble shower enclosure installation", "(min-width: 720px) 33vw, 85vw" %}
    </div>
    <div class="gallery__item">
      {% image "countertop-quartz-kitchen.jpg", "Blue quartz kitchen countertop with stainless steel sink", "(min-width: 720px) 33vw, 85vw" %}
    </div>
    <div class="gallery__item">
      {% image "commercial-bar-counter.jpg", "Commercial bar counter with LED lighting installation", "(min-width: 720px) 33vw, 85vw" %}
    </div>
    <div class="gallery__item">
      {% image "luxury-commercial-install.jpg", "Luxury commercial space with marble and gold accents", "(min-width: 720px) 33vw, 85vw" %}
    </div>
    <div class="gallery__item gallery__item--placeholder">
      <p>More projects coming soon</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section story" id="story">
  <div class="story__inner">
    <div class="story__copy">
      <span class="pill">About us</span>
      <h2>Built on Craftsmanship. Driven by Quality.</h2>
      <p>Astraea Fabrication is a locally owned and operated countertop fabrication company serving Shelburne and the surrounding Dufferin County area. We take pride in delivering exceptional stone work from initial measurement to final installation.</p>
      <p>Whether it's a kitchen renovation, a bathroom upgrade, or a full commercial build-out, we bring the same level of care and precision to every project.</p>
      <ul class="story__highlights">
        {% for highlight in store.highlights %}
        <li>{{ highlight }}</li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="story__media">
      {% image "logo-3d.png", "Astraea Fabrication logo", "(min-width: 960px) 400px, 85vw" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section reviews" id="reviews">
  <header class="section__header">
    <span class="pill">Testimonials</span>
    <h2>What our clients say</h2>
  </header>
  <div class="reviews__grid animate-grid">
    {% from "review-card.njk" import reviewCard %}
    {% for review in reviews.featured %}
      {{ reviewCard(review) }}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
  <div class="contact__grid">
    <div class="contact__info">
      <span class="pill">Contact</span>
      <h2 id="contact-heading">Get Your Free Quote</h2>
      <p>Ready to transform your space? Reach out for a free estimate. We'll work with you to find the perfect stone and design for your project.</p>
      <div class="contact__details">
        <p><strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:{{ store.phone | tel }}">{{ store.phone }}</a></p>
        <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ store.email }}">{{ store.email }}</a></p>
        <p><strong>Address:</strong> {{ store.address.street }}, {{ store.address.city }}, {{ store.address.province }} {{ store.address.postalCode }}</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn" href="{{ store.directionsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions</a>
    </div>
    <div class="contact__form-wrapper">
      <form class="quote-form" action="#" method="POST" novalidate>
        <div class="quote-form__row">
          <div class="quote-form__field">
            <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required aria-label="Your name">
          </div>
          <div class="quote-form__field">
            <input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="Phone" aria-label="Your phone number">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="quote-form__field">
          <input type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required aria-label="Your email">
        </div>
        <div class="quote-form__field">
          <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your project" rows="5" aria-label="Project details"></textarea>
        </div>
        <button class="btn quote-form__submit" type="submit">Send Request</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section visit" aria-labelledby="visit-heading">
  <div class="visit__grid">
    <div>
      <span class="pill">Visit us</span>
      <h2 id="visit-heading">Come See Our Showroom</h2>
      <p>Visit our shop to browse stone samples, discuss your project in person, and see our craftsmanship up close.</p>
      <div class="visit__cta">
        <a class="btn" href="{{ store.directionsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Directions</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="tel:{{ store.cta.orderPhone | tel }}">Call {{ store.phone }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="visit__map">
      <iframe title="Map showing Astraea Fabrication" src="https://www.google.com/maps?&amp;q={{ store.address.street | urlencode }}+{{ store.address.city | urlencode }}&amp;output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
